+//      overshoot < 15% of the step.
+//   3. AltitudeCapture       — 1,000 ft capture: overshoot < 150 ft, no
+//      re-excited speed excursion > 10 kt.
+//   4. ApproachVsTracking    — 3-deg glideslope track at 160 kts
